{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115193109008-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115214802\"/><p>今晚(15日)攪珠的今年第121期六合彩，攪珠結果為2、8、11、35、43、47，特別號碼48。頭獎無人中；二獎1注中，每注派彩1,740,060港元；三獎76注中，每注派61,050港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周二(17日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金為13,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T14:11:49.202577+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:31:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T15:57:00.447382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:05:18.845914+00:00","content_hash":"ba40fda4f69e57087a41760fd2b9b78bfe66e7ea7cfa43f0207b5939e218d655","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}